<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Nov palm oil exports 673,905t -Caleb.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Nov palm oil exports 673,905t -Caleb.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's November bulk palm oil exports at 673,905 tonnes against its estimate of 729,626 for October, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put October exports at 727,629 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
